# SAMO Store (`samo-store2`) — Read-Only Architecture & Wiring Audit

> [!CAUTION]
> **Urgent Live-Site Notice:** Although your storefront and admin UI look and feel clean on the surface, the **live Cloudflare backend APIs currently have zero server-side authentication** and **publicly leak all customer orders and subscriber data** to every visitor. Your earlier security audit appears to have hardened **`firestore.rules`**, but the live store actually reads and writes through **Cloudflare Pages Functions (`/api/*`) + D1 + R2**, which were left completely unprotected.

No files in `Charr111/samo-store2` were modified during this audit.

