## 4. Broken Persistence & Sync Issues (D1 / R2 / Firestore)

1. **Preorders Completely Broken in D1 (Field Mismatch + No Delete)** — [App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L2180-L2218), [catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L393-L404), [L935-L962](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L935-L962), [d1.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/server/d1.ts#L440-L451):
   - Frontend saves `{ selectedSize, selectedColor, customerContact, productImage, department, category }`.
   - D1 write binds `pr.size`, `pr.colorName`, `pr.clientName`, `pr.clientEmail`, `pr.clientPhone` — all `undefined`, inserting empty strings/nulls! On reload, preorders lose customer contact, size, and image.
   - Deleting a preorder never executes `DELETE FROM preorders` in D1, so deleted preorders reappear.
2. **Promo Codes Never Delete in D1** — [catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L964-L1036), [d1.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/server/d1.ts#L890-L920):
   - Only `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT(code) DO UPDATE` exists; no `DELETE FROM promo_codes`. Deleted codes come back after cache expiry.
   - Also D1 defaults `discount_type` to `'percent'` ([catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L1027)) while checkout checks `'percentage'` ([catalogLogic.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/utils/catalogLogic.ts#L1739)).
3. **Authorized Admins Never Persist to D1 or Firestore** — [catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L431-L436), [L584-L1060](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L584-L1060), [App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L3037-L3061):
   - `readFromD1` queries the `admins` table, but `writeToD1` has zero `INSERT`/`DELETE` logic for `admins`, and `App.tsx` never writes to Firestore `/admins/{email}`. New admins only live in `localStorage`/R2 cache and cannot pass `firestore.rules`.
4. **Stale-Forever Isolate Cache on Writes (`readCatalogSnapshot`)** — [catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L1253-L1263):
   - Unlike `GET /api/catalog` (which enforces a 30s TTL), `readCatalogSnapshot` returns `isolateCatalogCache` **forever without checking TTL**. Because `POST /api/catalog`, `sheets-sync`, `sitemap.xml`, and `merchant-feed.xml` all call `readCatalogSnapshot`, warm Cloudflare isolates diff and merge writes against stale state—risking dropped concurrent orders, resurrected deletions, and stale stock in Google Sheets / XML feeds.
5. **Firestore vs. D1 Settings Split-Brain** — [App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L1330-L1394) vs [L2941-L3245](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L2941-L3245):
   - 7 settings are dual-written to both Cloudflare D1 and Firestore `settings/store_config` and read from both without timestamp comparison. `sizeGuideConfig` is written to Firestore ([L3236](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L3236)) but never read in `onSnapshot`. If a non-super-admin (or anyone offline from Firestore) changes a setting, Firestore silently rejects the write (`catch {}`) and then overwrites the setting back on every visitor's screen.
6. **Categories Lose `description` & `slug` in D1** — [catalog.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L322-L335), [L788-L806](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/catalog.ts#L788-L806):
   - D1 `categories` table lacks `slug` and `description` columns, and `display_order = 0` deserializes as `sortOrder: undefined`.
7. **Worker OOM Risk on Large Video Uploads** — [r2-upload.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/functions/api/r2-upload.ts#L68-L92):
   - Accepts up to 35 MB videos as JSON base64 (~47 MB string) and decodes via `atob` + JS loop; peak RAM can exceed Cloudflare Workers' 128 MB isolate limit.
8. **Silent Write Failures & Unawaited State-Setter Patches** — [App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L289-L332), [L2390-L2403](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L2390-L2403), [L2705-L2764](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L2705-L2764), [imageCompression.ts](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/utils/imageCompression.ts#L675-L689):
   - Failed orders or admin saves still show success because `pushServerCatalogPatch` ignores `!res.ok` and swallows errors; `deleteMediaFromR2` returns `{ deletedKeys }` even on HTTP 500.

