## 5. Disconnected Controls, Storefront Bugs & Admin Traps

### A. Storefront Customer-Facing Bugs
1. **Direct Product Links Fail for First-Time Visitors** ([App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L503-L514), [L1270-L1319](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L1270-L1319)):
   - On initial load, the URL parser runs immediately against `INITIAL_PRODUCTS` (seed data) and sets `directUrlInitializedRef.current = true`. When real D1 products finish loading moments later, it skips URL resolution—so **shared links, Google Shopping clicks, and Meta ads pointing to Admin-added products never open the product modal** for new visitors.
2. **Broken URL Bar & Double Back-Clicks on Navigation** ([App.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/App.tsx#L1675-L1708), [HeroVideoSection.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/components/HeroVideoSection.tsx#L299-L310), [Navbar.tsx](file:///home/antigravity/Charr111/samo-store2/src/components/Navbar.tsx#L89-L94)):
   - Buttons call `onNavigate(newRoute)` immediately followed by `onSelectCategory(cat)`. `handleSelectCategory` reads the stale pre-render `currentRoute` and pushes the **old URL** right back onto the address bar (e.g., clicking **Shop Women** on `/home` renders Women while resetting the URL bar to `/home`).
